	(text "voltage divider to detect 5v bus\nWhen 5v line is active, the mcu will see:\n5V * (510k/(510k+1M)) = ~1.69V -> logic high"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 42.164 33.274 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9bafb84e-71e7-45a7-9d9f-696c0f8dd8f7")
	)
	(text "The connector is used to prototype a 4-pogo pin charging setup\n- It just feeds the +VBUS with 5 V input (PIN 1)\n- The Detect Pin (Pin 3) is pulled low with 10k resulting in a 0 V reading, when not connected.\n  -> the Detect Pin on the BASE is pulled high with 47k, essentially forming a \"split voltage divider\"\n  -> When a connection is made, the BASE will switch from digital high to low which can be detected via an interupt.\n  -> The sensor will use the LPCOMP and will detect the connnection, when the Voltage goes from 0V to ~ 0.31V (on 1V8 line) \n- The UART_TX Pin (Pin 4) is a one way communication line from the sensor to the Base, sending small data like ID or charging status"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 21.336 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9c761ec1-cc41-44b4-9091-8b20c6c5ae17")
	)
	(text "BATTERY PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.974 183.642 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 1.016)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b6e10676-41aa-43a6-8ff8-47b9ecb8b67a")
	)
	(text "CHARGING 4-PIN CONNECTOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.806 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 1.016)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ee07cdb4-d334-4c0f-9b6b-54f3611bbf7a")
	)
	(text "The power rail only supplying the MCU is being monitored for its current consumption.\nSpikes in the consumption will be used to locate BLE_TX and BLE_RX Events. \nThese Events are then used to synchronize the timestamp with the central node.\n\n1 Ω Shunt Resistor + 50 V-Gain at 1V8 load -> Ezurio reports 24 mA max. current for BLE (+7dBm TX)\n-> Vout​ = 0.025 A * 1 Ω * 50 V (Gain) = 1.25 V\n-> max. readable current ~36 mA -> whole range is covered and good trade off with resolution"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 157.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
